  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Yayasan Pantau Indonesia - 2025 ICMPS Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project in Eastern Indonesia, implemented by Yayasan Pantau, aims to empower young journalists including photojournalists to advocate for human rights and social justice issues through their reporting, storytelling and photos. By emphasizing both theoretical and practical aspects, the project seeks to equip journalists, activists, student press and minorities in local contexts to be skilled in effectively reporting on human rights issues.</narrative>
  </description>
